From 261d463cb253e72d9ce75efdf8455d1fc71105ec Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 10:02:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SEO: fix Semrush Site Audit issues, link use cases to
 taqt.com

- Remove the 4 meta-refresh redirect stubs (meta refresh, duplicate titles,
  single internal link); 404 page sends their visitors to the matching
  taqt.com use case or help center article
- Home (EN/FR): use-case cards link to taqt.com use-case pages (no duplicate
  content), SoftwareApplication JSON-LD, image dimensions
- Pricing (EN/FR): cost examples, extra FAQ, FAQPage + breadcrumb JSON-LD
  to fix low word count
- Footer use-case links, 1200x630 Open Graph images
- Add llms.txt, 404 page, sitemap lastmod; compress qr.png (213 KB -> 32 KB)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XY737Yj2qkaEpPQPCwdGHB
